DEFINE POPUP shortcut SHORTCUT RELATIVE FROM MROW(),MCOL()
DEFINE BAR 1 OF shortcut PROMPT "Single Authorization Code"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF shortcut PROMPT "Multiple Authorization Code"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF shortcut acopt = 1
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF shortcut acopt = 2

ACTIVATE POPUP shortcut